==Old Norse==

===Etymology 1===
{{etymid|non|this}}
From earlier {{m|non|sási}} {{q|attested in runic insriptions}}, originally the normal declension of {{m|non|sá}} + ''-si''. Cognate with {{cog|ang|þes}} ({{cog|en|this}}), {{cog|goh|dese}} ({{cog|de|diese}}).

====Alternative forms====
* {{alt|non|þessi}}

